Drag platform pieces for the port.

Drag support needs per-port DragController constants and image handling,
which the GLib port's file provides without GLib dependencies, plus a
drag-and-drop pasteboard, drag image and file list. Drags never leave the
engine's page, so those are the ordinary pasteboard, no image and no files.

